  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assessment - Identification LULUCF Med</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This study shall provide a comprehensive assessment of land use and management practices in the Southern Neighbourhood region, with a focus on the management of forests and wetlands, and an analysis of how land use and land use changes contribute to climate change. It shall also provide recommendations on actions that could be implemented, through a regional program, to improve sustainable land use/forest and wetland practices so as to enhance climate mitigation while also promoting climate adaptation, disaster risk management and biodiversity conservation&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
